<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Jan 31, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Jan 31   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,868   2,947  10,490</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     177     151     278</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    838     838   1,306</p>
<p>Total					 3,883   3,936  12,074</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,544   1,271    unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     276     270    unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,558   3,558    unq</p>
<p>Total					 5,378   5,099    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
